[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15902.51, "timestamp": "04:25:02", "text": "东西。该死，那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15906.389, "timestamp": "04:25:06", "text": "好的。不，Ar，你死了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15909.11, "timestamp": "04:25:09", "text": "不，我还没死。我只是个媒体人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15919.75, "timestamp": "04:25:19", "text": "我应该拨打紧急电话吗？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15922.469, "timestamp": "04:25:22", "text": "好吧，他活下来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15925.67, "timestamp": "04:25:25", "text": "我的天哪。我要跟着乔克过来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15926.67, "timestamp": "04:25:26", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15930.71, "timestamp": "04:25:30", "text": "猜测。这到底是什么鬼东西？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15939.269, "timestamp": "04:25:39", "text": "问？我现在得去拿我的东西了，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15941.83, "timestamp": "04:25:41", "text": "它就像两块古代碎片，而且是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15943.25, "timestamp": "04:25:43", "text": "一路向上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15951.429, "timestamp": "04:25:51", "text": "那里。与其专注于法力，不如专注于其他方面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15953.67, "timestamp": "04:25:53", "text": "寻找B。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15957.269, "timestamp": "04:25:57", "text": "是的，大概会用庄园那边。"}]